    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1723",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1726",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Diese drei Töpfe bilden das Grundgerüst für die weitere Einordnung in den Quadranten. Jeder Topf enthält Use Cases mit unterschiedlichen Verifikationseigenschaften – sie verteilen sich also über mehrere Quadranten.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1727",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1732",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "5.3  Einordnung in den Quadranten",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1735",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Auf Basis der Interviews und der eigenen Domänenerfahrung wurden die identifizierten Use Cases in den Verifikationsquadranten eingeordnet. Diese erste Einordnung dient als Hypothese, die in den folgenden Iterationen validiert und ggf. angepasst wird.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1736",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1741",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift3"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift3",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Quadrant B: Schwer zu generieren, leicht zu verifizieren",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1748",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Dies ist der ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Sweet Spot für KI-Unterstützung",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": ". Hier kann die KI die schwierige Generierungsarbeit übernehmen, während der Mensch als schneller, effizienter Verifikator agiert.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1753",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Security Questionnaires: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Die KI durchsucht interne Wissensdatenbanken, frühere Antworten und technische Dokumentation, um Antworten zu generieren. Ein Fachexperte kann die einzelnen Antworten relativ schnell auf Korrektheit prüfen – ist die Aussage technisch korrekt? Entspricht sie dem aktuellen Stand?",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1758",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "NDA Review: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Die KI analysiert eingehende NDAs, markiert potenziell kritische Klauseln und vergleicht mit Standardvorlagen. Ein juristisch geschulter Reviewer kann schnell prüfen: Sind die markierten Klauseln tatsächlich problematisch? Fehlt etwas?",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1763",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Contract Redlining: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Die KI erstellt Redline-Vorschläge basierend auf unternehmensinternen Standards. Der Reviewer prüft die vorgeschlagenen Änderungen gegen bekannte Regeln.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1768",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Support-Ticket-Bearbeitung: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Die KI entwirft Lösungsvorschläge basierend auf ähnlichen vergangenen Tickets. Der Support-Mitarbeiter kann die vorgeschlagene Lösung schnell auf Plausibilität prüfen.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1769",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1775",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift3"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift3",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Quadrant C: Leicht zu generieren, schwer zu verifizieren",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1782",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Hier lauert die ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "größte Gefahr",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": " für unkritischen KI-Einsatz. Behauptungen sind schnell aufgestellt, aber ihre Überprüfung erfordert Zeit, Daten oder ist prinzipiell unklar.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1787",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "ROI-Cases: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Es ist leicht zu behaupten „Unsere Software spart Ihnen 30% der Kosten“. Aber die Verifikation erfordert Monate an Produktivdaten, Vergleichsmessungen und kontrollierte Bedingungen. Oft ist eine echte Verifikation erst nach der Kaufentscheidung möglich – wenn überhaupt.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1792",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Prognosen & Forecasts: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Eine Pipeline-Prognose ist schnell erstellt. Ob sie zutrifft, zeigt sich erst Monate später.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1797",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Langfristige Wertargumentationen: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Aussagen über strategischen Mehrwert, Marktpositionierung oder Effizienzgewinne sind leicht zu formulieren, aber notorisch schwer zu belegen.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1798",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1803",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift3"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift3",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Quadrant D: Schwer zu generieren, schwer zu verifizieren",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1806",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Der anspruchsvollste Bereich – hier sind sowohl die Lösungsfindung als auch die Überprüfung komplex:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1811",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Komplexe Pricing-Modelle: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Bei mehrdimensionalen Enterprise-Deals mit Custom-Pricing ist sowohl die Erstellung als auch die Bewertung der Angemessenheit schwierig.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1816",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Strategische Account-Planung: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Die optimale Strategie für einen Enterprise-Deal zu entwickeln erfordert tiefes Kontextwissen. Ob die Strategie optimal war, zeigt sich oft erst im Nachhinein.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1817",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1822",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift3"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift3",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Quadrant A: Leicht zu generieren, leicht zu verifizieren",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1825",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Use Cases, die gut automatisierbar sind und wenig menschliche Aufsicht erfordern:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1828",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Standard-Status-Updates und Meeting-Zusammenfassungen",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1833",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Einfache Datenabfragen und CRM-Updates / Anreicherungen",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1836",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Template-basierte Kommunikation",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1837",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1842",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "5.4  Iterationen auf der Use-Case-Ebene",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1845",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "In den folgenden Unterkapiteln werden die wesentlichen Iterationsschleifen auf der Use-Case-Ebene dokumentiert. Jedes Unterkapitel folgt der Echelon-Struktur: Exploration, Hypothese, Prototyp, Evaluation, Learnings.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1846",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1851",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift3"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift3",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "5.4.1  Security Questionnaires – Echelons",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1856",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Ausgangslage: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "In 5 von 7 Interviews wurde das Beantworten von Security Questionnaires als einer der größten Zeitfresser genannt. Typischerweise müssen Vertriebler rare Ressourcen (Entwickler, Security-Experten) involvieren, was den Prozess verlangsamt und Frustration erzeugt.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1857",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1860",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Echelon 1 – Erste Hypothese:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1863",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Hypothese: KI kann auf Basis vergangener Antworten und interner Dokumentation Antwortvorschläge generieren",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1866",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Prototyp: Einfaches Chat-Interface, das Fragen annimmt und Antworten vorschlägt",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1869",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Evaluation: Funktioniert grundsätzlich, aber das Interface ist nicht optimal – Reviewer verlieren den Überblick",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1874",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Learning: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Der Review-Prozess braucht eine Struktur, die es ermöglicht, viele Antworten effizient nacheinander zu prüfen",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1875",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1878",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Echelon 2 – Überarbeitetes Interface:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1881",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Hypothese: Ein listenbasiertes Interface mit Sidebar ermöglicht effizienteres Reviewing",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1884",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Prototyp: Notification-Inbox-Stil mit Thread-Liste links, Detail-Ansicht rechts",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1887",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Evaluation: Deutlich bessere Effizienz, Reviewer können Use Cases schnell durcharbeiten",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1892",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Learning: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Das Notification-Inbox-Pattern eignet sich hervorragend für Use Cases mit hohem Durchlauf und schneller Verifikation",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1893",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1896",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "italic",
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "rgb": "666666",
              },
              "type": "color",
            },
          ],
          "text": "[Hinweis: Dieser Abschnitt wird in der finalen Thesis mit Screenshots, konkreten Nutzerfeedback-Zitaten und detaillierten Beschreibungen der vier Prototyp-Versionen ergänzt.]",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1897",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1902",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift3"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift3",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "5.4.2  NDA Review & Approval – Echelons",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1907",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Ausgangslage: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "NDAs vom Kunden müssen schnell geprüft und freigegeben werden. Verzögerungen hier blockieren den gesamten weiteren Prozess.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1911",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "KI kann kritische Terms identifizieren und mit Standards abgleichen",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1914",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Reviewer sieht markierte Stellen und kann schnell entscheiden",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1919",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Parallele zum Security Questionnaire: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Ähnliches Verifikationsmuster – das Notification-Inbox-Pattern funktioniert auch hier",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1920",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1925",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift3"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift3",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "5.4.3  ROI-Case-Erstellung – Echelons",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1930",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Ausgangslage: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "ROI-Cases sind fundamental anders: Die Generierung einer Behauptung ist einfach, aber die Verifikation ist extrem schwierig und zeitintensiv.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1933",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Erste Versuche, ein ähnliches Review-Interface wie bei Security Questionnaires zu nutzen, scheitern",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1936",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Die Verifikation ist nicht binär (richtig/falsch), sondern graduell und kontextabhängig",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1939",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Erfordert Zugriff auf Produktdaten, Nutzungsstatistiken, Umfrageergebnisse",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1944",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Learning: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Das Notification-Inbox-Pattern passt hier NICHT. Use Cases mit schwieriger Verifikation brauchen ein grundlegend anderes Interface-Paradigma – eines, das den Nutzer durch einen längeren Analyse- und Validierungsprozess begleitet.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1945",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1948",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "italic",
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "rgb": "666666",
              },
              "type": "color",
            },
          ],
          "text": "[Hinweis: Weitere Use-Case-Echelons (Customer Support Tickets, Org-Struktur-Analyse, etc.) werden in der finalen Thesis analog dokumentiert.]",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1949",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1954",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "5.5  Iteration auf der Quadranten-Ebene",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1957",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Nachdem mehrere Use Cases auf der Use-Case-Ebene untersucht wurden, werden die Erkenntnisse auf der Quadranten-Ebene verdichtet. Hier zeigen sich übergreifende Muster:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1958",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1961",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Erkenntnis 1 – Quadrant B (schwer generieren, leicht verifizieren):",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1964",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Alle untersuchten Use Cases in diesem Quadranten teilen eine gemeinsame Eigenschaft: Der Review-Prozess ist schnell, der Durchlauf ist hoch, und die KI-generierten Ergebnisse können effizient von einem Fachexperten geprüft werden. Das Notification-Inbox-Pattern hat sich konsistent als geeignet erwiesen.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1965",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1969",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Erkenntnis 2 – Quadrant C (leicht generieren, schwer verifizieren):",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1972",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Use Cases in diesem Quadranten erfordern ein fundamental anderes Interface-Paradigma. Die Verifikation ist nicht schnell und nicht binär. Stattdessen braucht es ein Interface, das den Nutzer durch einen strukturierten Analyse- und Validierungsprozess führt – möglicherweise über längere Zeiträume hinweg.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1973",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1976",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Erkenntnis 3 – Team Assignment als Querschnittsthema:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1979",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Unabhängig vom Quadranten hat sich gezeigt, dass die korrekte Zuordnung von Aufgaben an die richtigen Personen (Team Assignment / Routing) ein kritischer Erfolgsfaktor ist. Die KI muss nicht nur Inhalte generieren, sondern auch wissen, wer der richtige Reviewer ist.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1982",
        "propsJson": "{}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "breakType": "page",
          },
          "type": "hard_break",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1988",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift1"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift1",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "6  Design Patterns für Human-AI Interfaces",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1989",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1992",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Auf Basis der iterativen Forschung lassen sich nun Design Patterns pro Quadrant ableiten. Diese Patterns sind keine starren Regeln, sondern empirisch fundierte Gestaltungsprinzipien, die als Ausgangspunkt für das Interface-Design dienen.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1993",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-1998",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "6.1  Pattern 1: Notification Inbox (Quadrant B)",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2003",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Anwendungsbereich: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Use Cases mit schwieriger Generierung, aber einfacher und schneller Verifikation.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2004",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2007",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Beschreibung:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2010",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Das Notification-Inbox-Pattern orientiert sich an E-Mail-Clients: Auf der linken Seite befindet sich eine Sidebar mit allen offenen Threads/Prozessen (z.B. „Security Questionnaire #4711 für Firma Acme“). Auf der rechten Seite wird das spezifische Interface für den jeweiligen Task-Typ angezeigt. Der Reviewer arbeitet sich durch die Inbox und kann schnell entscheiden: Approve, Reject, Modify.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2011",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2014",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Charakteristiken:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2017",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Hoher Durchlauf: Viele einzelne Items können schnell abgearbeitet werden",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2020",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Binäre oder nahezu binäre Entscheidungen: Richtig/Falsch, Akzeptieren/Ablehnen",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2023",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "KI hat Vorarbeit geleistet: Der Mensch verifiziert, nicht generiert",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2026",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Integriertes Team Assignment: Das System routet an den richtigen Experten",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2029",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Kontextanreicherung: Relevante Hintergrundinformationen werden mitgeliefert",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2030",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2033",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Geeignete Use Cases:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2036",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Security Questionnaire Review",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2039",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "NDA Approval",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2042",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Contract Redline Review",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2045",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Support-Ticket-Prüfung",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2048",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Feature-Request-Triage",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2049",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2054",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "6.2  Pattern 2: Guided Analysis Workspace (Quadrant C)",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2059",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Anwendungsbereich: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Use Cases mit einfacher Generierung (Behauptungen), aber schwieriger, langwieriger Verifikation.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2060",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2063",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Beschreibung:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2066",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Anders als das Notification-Inbox-Pattern ist dieses Pattern auf längere, tiefergehende Analyseprozesse ausgelegt. Es bietet dem Nutzer einen strukturierten Arbeitsbereich, in dem er über Zeit Evidenz sammeln, Daten aggregieren und Schritt für Schritt eine Verifikation aufbauen kann.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2067",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2070",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Charakteristiken:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2073",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Niedriger Durchlauf: Wenige, aber komplexe Items",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2076",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Graduelle Verifikation: Nicht binär, sondern ein Prozess des zunehmenden Vertrauens",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2079",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Datenüber-Zeit: Erfordert Zugriff auf historische und Echtzeitdaten",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2082",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Collaborative: Oft müssen mehrere Stakeholder beitragen",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2085",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Dashboard-ähnlich: Visualisierung von Trends, Metriken, Vergleichen",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2086",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2089",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Geeignete Use Cases:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2092",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "ROI-Case-Aufbau und -Validierung",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2095",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Langfristige Wertargumentation",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2098",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "NPS-basierte Kundenzufriedenheits-Analyse",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2101",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"Listenabsatz","numbering":{"numId":2,"ilvl":0},"spacing":{"after":100,"line":300,"lineRule":"auto"},"opaqueProps":[{"tag":"w:numPr","attrs":{},"subtree":[{"w:ilvl":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"0"}},{"w:numId":[],":@":{"@_w:val":"2"}}],"rawAttrs":{}}]}",
        "styleId": "Listenabsatz",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Strategische Account-Planung",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2102",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2107",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "6.3  Pattern 3: Auto-Execute with Audit Trail (Quadrant A)",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2112",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Anwendungsbereich: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Use Cases mit einfacher Generierung UND einfacher Verifikation.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2113",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2116",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Beschreibung:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2120",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Hier kann die KI nahezu autonom agieren. Das Interface zeigt dem Menschen lediglich an, was getan wurde (Audit Trail), und bietet die Möglichkeit zur Intervention bei Bedarf. Der Mensch ist kein aktiver Reviewer, sondern ein passiver Beobachter mit Veto-Recht.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2121",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2126",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "6.4  Pattern 4: Structured Co-Creation (Quadrant D)",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2131",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Anwendungsbereich: ",
          "type": "text",
        },
        {
          "text": "Use Cases, bei denen sowohl Generierung als auch Verifikation schwierig sind.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2132",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2135",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold",
            },
          ],
          "text": "Beschreibung:",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2138",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":200,"line":320,"lineRule":"auto"}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Hier arbeiten Mensch und KI als gleichberechtigte Partner. Die KI unterstützt bei der Generierung, der Mensch bringt Kontextwissen und Urteilsfähigkeit ein. Verifikation ist ein iterativer, gemeinsamer Prozess. Das Interface muss intensive Interaktion und gemeinsames Arbeiten ermöglichen.",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2139",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2144",
        "propsJson": "{"styleId":"berschrift2"}",
        "styleId": "berschrift2",
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "6.5  Zusammenfassung: Quadrant → Pattern Mapping",
          "type": "text",
        },
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "alignment": null,
        "paragraphId": "n-2145",
        "propsJson": "{"spacing":{"after":100}}",
        "styleId": null,
      },
      "type": "paragraph",
    },
    {
